<title>USA: Ecorse Public Schools, Mich., $46 mln repriced.</title>
<headline>Ecorse Public Schools, Mich., $46 mln repriced.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>PaineWebber Inc. said Wednesday it repriced Ecorse Public Schools, Mich.'s $46 million bond deal, adjusting yields in several maturities but leaving the top yield in 2027 unchanged at 5.67 percent.</p>
<p>The repricing follows:</p>
