<p>WAYNE COUNTY, MICHIGAN</p>
<p>RE: $45,555,000*</p>
<p>1997 SCHOOL BUILDING AND SITE BONDS</p>
<p>(UNLIMITED TAX GENERAL OBLIGATION)</p>
<p>NOTE REPRICING.</p>
<p>VERBAL AWARD.</p>
<p>THE ACCOUNT IS CLOSED.</p>
